==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Information Pack|Bellossom|promo}}, an {{TCG|Unnumbered Promotional cards|unnumbered promotional card}} only released in Japan.
* '''Leaf Step''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Shining Celebi|79}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

